15)----------------------------Projection: my_customers.c_customer_sk, my_customers.c_current_addr_sk, store_sales.ss_sold_date_sk, store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price
16)------------------------------Inner Join: my_customers.c_customer_sk = store_sales.ss_customer_sk
17)--------------------------------SubqueryAlias: my_customers
